gnome-shell-extension-codex-claude-usage (1.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Show per-model Claude quotas (e.g. the weekly Fable limit) from the
    usage API's limits array; internal code-name keys are never shown.
  * New setting "Per-model windows" to hide the scoped windows.
  * Use the monochrome Claude and Codex brand marks from thesvg.org (MIT).

